            "code": "\n\tsecurity \u003d value[\u0027security\u0027]\n\tcanCreate \u003d False\n\tcanEdit \u003d False\n\tif security[\u0027userCRUD\u0027] is not None and security[\u0027userId\u0027] is not None:\n\t\tif security[\u0027userCRUD\u0027][\u0027isGatewayAdmin\u0027] or security[\u0027userCRUD\u0027][\u0027editOperations\u0027][\u0027enabled\u0027]: \n\t\t\tcanCreate \u003d True\n\t\t\tcanEdit \u003d True if value[\u0027assetId\u0027] else False\n\t\n\treturn {\"canCreate\": canCreate, \"canDelete\": canEdit, \"canRead\": True, \"canUpdate\": canEdit}",
